vFM Player - ADPCM samples

SD folder: /vFM/midi/banks/ADPCM

Optional FITOM WAV sample resources. Preserve keyboard subfolders and filenames. These are instrument samples, not a general WAV music library.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/midi/banks/ADPCM

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
